  "prefLabel": "Ed 1303.06 Substantial Changes to an Approved Project",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1303.06 Substantial Changes to an Approved Project. The receiving board shall notify the department of any substantial changes to a renovation project approved under this section. Substantial changes shall include a change in project cost of 5% or greater or the addition or removal of a career and technical education program, or any substantial change which alters the scope of the project.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1300) #12573, eff 7-14-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed1300.html"
